diagnostics calls 12 function values from a slice in a loop. With the default
-fanout 8 all entries must be printed as one "group of N entries via dynamic call"
block naming the Candidate of each entry: every out-of-scope construct of package
murky contributes its Unresolved entry (channel, field, map, slice, recover,
reflection, errgroup, atomic, unsafe, any), and murky.Last its global.
